- Shared API rows: 8 of 8 driven.
- CLI/lifecycle rows: 0 of 8, explicitly bounded to the owning CLI/lifecycle leaves. No `ax` executable, CLI Result renderer, transport, fencing, or mutation caller is introduced here.
- Durable mutation: none in `sessquery` read/plan/summary entries; crash/idempotency is not applicable to this operation. Existing repository recovery/idempotency tests remain part of the full suite.
- Capability claims: no new provider/platform capability; authoritative summaries admit exactly the seven provhost-owned names and refuse invented names.

